    {
      "fileName": "gadget-specialist.json",
      "id": "DQN7YC7s7T0pL6Aa",
      "name": "Gadget Specialist",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "DQN7YC7s7T0pL6Aa",
        "folder": "xbCKkmp7Z0yDZjMH",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Gadget Specialist",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Rather than just using your gadgets for various boosts and tweaks, you also craft a few specific temporary consumable gadgets each day. You gain the formulas for three common or uncommon gadgets. Each day during your daily preparations, you can create two temporary gadgets from your formula book. Gadgets prepared in this way don't cost you any resources to Craft and don't have any sale value. They are temporary items and fall apart the next time you make your daily preparations if you haven't already used them.</p>\n<p>If you're a master in Crafting, you can create three gadgets per day, and you gain three additional common or uncommon gadget formulas. If you're legendary in Crafting, you can create four gadgets per day, and you gain another additional three common or uncommon gadget formulas, for a total of nine.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "expert in Crafting"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Guns & Gears"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "craftableItems": [
                "item:trait:gadget"
              ],
              "isDailyPrep": true,
              "key": "CraftingAbility",
              "maxSlots": "max(2,@actor.system.skills.crafting.rank)",
              "priority": 60,
              "slug": "gadget-specialist"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "inventor"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 4,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "megaton-strike.json",
      "id": "BEqXsP6UqARzpEFD",
      "name": "Megaton Strike",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "BEqXsP6UqARzpEFD",
        "folder": "xbCKkmp7Z0yDZjMH",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Megaton Strike",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You activate gears, explosives, and other hidden mechanisms in your innovation to make a powerful attack. You make a Strike, dealing an extra die of weapon damage. If you're at least 10th level, increase this to two extra dice, and if you're at least 18th level, increase it to three extra dice. The type of Strike you can make depends on your innovation.</p><ul><li><strong>Armor</strong> You Strike with a melee unarmed attack or a melee weapon. To use a melee weapon for this, you must have prepared it in advance with special contraptions when you make your daily preparations.</li><li><strong>Construct</strong> Your minion innovation Strikes.</li><li><strong>Weapon</strong> You Strike with your weapon innovation.</li></ul><p><strong>Unstable Function</strong> You put even more force into the Strike, though you risk stress fractures to your innovation. Add the unstable trait to Megaton Strike. The Strike deals another extra damage die, for a total of two extra dice at 4th level, three at 10th level, and four at 18th level.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If your innovation is a minion, it can take this action rather than you.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "armor, construct, or weapon innovation"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Guns & Gears"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "RollOption",
              "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Inventor.Unstable.UnstableFunction.Label",
              "option": "unstable-state",
              "toggleable": true
            },
            {
              "key": "RollOption",
              "option": "megaton-strike",
              "predicate": [
                {
                  "not": "feature:construct-innovation"
                }
              ],
              "toggleable": true
            },
            {
              "key": "AdjustStrike",
              "mode": "add",
              "predicate": [
                "unstable-state",
                "megaton-strike"
              ],
              "property": "traits",
              "value": "unstable"
            },
            {
              "diceNumber": "ternary(gte(@actor.level, 18), 3, ternary(gte(@actor.level, 10), 2, 1))",
